        R-->>S: 200
    end
    Note over S,R: Residual (acknowledged, R-5 mitigates): 5-minute replay window without nonces<br/>(receiver.py:113-117 - "cannot tell a replay from a genuine resend inside the window").<br/>Bounded seen-signature cache (timestamp, signature) at ingress turns replays into 403/409s;<br/>nonces (jti) are the v1.1 contract option requiring sender cooperation.
